{"version":1,"content":"<p>華為將在一場國際學術會議上發佈有關其自研高帶寬內存（HBM）晶片設計的白皮書。一些業內人士推測，該設計可能優於目前由三星、SK海力士和美光主導的現有產品。這場發佈會定於2027年2月16日在三藩市舉行的國際固態電路會議上進行。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588246.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:44:29.507576+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:18:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_hash":"4b693d5e81a2a36136a9d4f7bbf623a4c7ac421054f0e6f5d3b9047e45600464","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}